    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Falao ali'wongezya lu'duko ku' V'aizilaeli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 5:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho lyav'i'taga itungo, Mose na Aloni v'ayaga ku'mwa Falao, na v'amuwi'laga ati', “Gu'ku' Mulungu, Mulungu wa Izilaeli ali'yomba i'vi: ‘V'aleku'li'le v'antu' v'anne v'awu'ke, v'akambezezye mwanya ku' ibalangu'.’ ” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.5.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 5:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali'vi Falao wav'awu'zyaga, “Gu'ku' Mulungu mwenu'yo hu' nde, mpaka muku'zye na ku'v'aleku'li'la V'aizilaeli v'awu'ke? Ene nkamumanya Gu'ku' Mulungu mwenu'yo, na nkav'ile ku'v'aleku'li'la V'aizilaeli v'awu'ke.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.5.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 5:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haho Mose na Aloni v'amuwi'laga, “Mulungu wa V'aebulania wapomaga niswe. Ku'li'ku'lomba u'ku'leku'li'le ku'yu'mbe musi'nzo gwa nsiku' idatu' mu ibalangu' ku'kamufumi'zye vitaambo Gu'ku' Mulungu, Mulungu wiswe. U'lu' ng'o, iswe alaku'gu'me na malwile ga tauni ninga na lu'panga.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.5.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 5:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali'vi mutemi wa Misili wasu'v'yaga ati', “Inywe Mose na Aloni, ku' ki' muv'alekya v'antu' mili'mo zyav'o? Su'v'agi ku' mili'mo zinywe.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.5.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangi' Falao wayombaga, “Lingagi, v'antu' v'enav'a v'ali' v'ingi, na inywe muli'v'ahangi'li'zya ku'tu'mama mili'mo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.5.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.5.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 5:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lu'siku' lwene lu'lo Falao wav'alagi'li'zyaga v'i'mi'li'zi na v'anyampala na ku'v'awi'la ati', ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.5.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 5:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ku'lamuli'la walelo, v'antu' v'enav'a ku'du' muv'ape hangi' mawulule ga ku'v'ezezya matofali. V'eni'ki'li' v'av'e v'ali'ya ku'kikoov'ela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.5.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 5:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali'vi lu'v'alo lwa matofali ago gali'v'eziv'agwa nsiku' zyose, lu'v'e lwene lu'lo. Ku'du' lwangi'le ninga hadoo. V'ali'bu'bu'zya ati', ‘Ku'leku'li'le ku'ye ku'kamufumi'zye Mulungu wiswe vitaambo.’ V'ali'yomba vyeni'vyo ku'nguno v'enav'a v'ali' v'avila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.5.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 5:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "V'ezi mili'mo zyav'o ku'v'a milambu muno, ki'gele v'azifumi'zye lu'yi'lo na ku'leka ku'degeleka wu'fi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.5.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 5:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.5.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hohene v'i'mi'li'zi na v'anyampala v'a v'antu' v'afumaga na ku'v'awi'la V'aizilaeli ati', “Falao ali'yomba i'vi: ‘Nkasye mupe hangi' mawulule. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.5.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 5:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yagi mukakoov'e mawulule inywe v'eni'ki'li', ku' ki'la lwandi' u'ko mukowolile ku'gapandi'ka. Ali'vi mili'mo zinywe ziku'leka ku'dohiwa ninga hadoo.’ ” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.5.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hohene v'antu' v'asambalaga hose mu nsi' ya Misili, ki'gele v'akoov'e mawulule ga ku'v'ezezya matofali, ali'vi v'apandi'kaga makung'unti'lwa ga viliwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.5.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 5:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nav'o v'i'mi'li'zi v'av'akang'anti'zyaga na ku'yomba, “Mugelani'zye mili'mo zinywe zya nsiku' zyose ki'ti' itungo i'lo ndi' mwaletelagwe mawulule.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.5.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.5.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 5:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "V'i'mi'li'zi v'a Ki'misili v'av'agu'maga v'anyampala v'a Ki'izilaeli, av'o v'asogolilwe kwi'mi'li'zya mili'mo, na ku'v'awu'zya, “Ku' ki' mukafikizye lu'v'alo lwinywe lwa nsiku' zyose lwa matofali, igolo na walelo ki'ti' ha mbu'ki'?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.5.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.5.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 5:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.5.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.5.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 5:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haho v'anyampala v'a Ki'izilaeli v'ayaga ku'kamuli'li'la Falao na ku'yomba ati', “Ku' ki' u'li'ku'v'ezezya vyeni'vi iswe v'asese v'ako? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.5.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.5.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 5:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "V'asese v'ako ku'kav'ile ku'piwa mawulule, ninga vyeni'vyo v'ali'ku'gahani'zya ku'v'ezya matofali. Lingaga, ku'li'gu'mwa, ali'vi ipu'v'yo li'li' lya v'antu' v'ako.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.5.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.5.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 5:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Falao wasu'v'yaga ati', “Inywe muli' v'avila, v'avila v'ahanya, hene muli'yomba, ‘Ku'leku'li'le ku'ye ku'kamufumi'zye Gu'ku' Mulungu vitaambo.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.5.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.5.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 5:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gi'si' yagi ku' mili'mo. Mukav'ile ku'piwa mawulule ninga madoo, na matofali muv'ezye ku' lu'v'alo lwene lu'lo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.5.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.5.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 5:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hohene v'anyampala v'a Ki'izilaeli v'awonaga v'ali' mu lu'duko, aho v'awi'lagwa ati', “Mukav'ile ku'pu'ngu'zya lu'v'alo lwa matofali ga ki'la lu'siku'.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.5.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.5.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 5:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.5.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.5.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 5:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho v'afumaga ku'mwa Falao, v'apomaga na Mose na Aloni mu nzi'la, aho v'av'age v'av'alindi'lile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.5.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.5.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 5:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hohene v'av'awi'laga Mose na Aloni ati', “Gu'ku' Mulungu ali'wone igambo lyeni'li', amufumi'zye inywe wu'yangu'! Ku'nguno mwaku'v'ezyaga ku'mufufume Falao na v'akumba v'akwe, na ku'v'apa nguno ya ku'ku'wu'laga.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.5.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.5.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mulungu ali'lahana ku'v'akomola V'aizilaeli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 5:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.5.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.5.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 5:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangi' Mose wasu'v'aga ku'mwa Gu'ku' Mulungu na wamuwi'laga ati', “Ev'e Gu'ku', ku' ki' wav'aletelile lu'duko v'antu' v'enav'a? Ku' ki' wantu'mile ene? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.5.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.5.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 5:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku'fuma aho ndi' naya ku'kasu'nsu'mu'la na Falao ku' lina lyako, nawe wav'av'ezezyaga makoye v'antu' v'enav'a, nanho u'kav'ezizye igambo ninga li'mo lya ku'v'akomola v'antu' v'ako!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.5.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.5.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
